# The Distal Bypass

This note states, in plain but precise terms, what the firm's central deviceƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;RgMB1zt5n13eU6e1Zvt5149JdPlavi1OJvlhLDlIqrYƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Riz-pJEcSGkR11XLkeiVXTLAwYN_-fxoqvbTLHqBG5Uƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkb21ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;jPlwh8dP-XT4b_umgDgltg8gYHV0ilaJSj76F2aL114ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;kxMHeQMZCP14C3bhXu4bE-nfjweLtbJO00aSuzshd9oƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkmdistal bypassƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;iZ7XzVPEEQ68G4tvdq3bXdV7uN4lg45BKrQpzIJ4knsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxø## What it is

The distal bypass is not a piece of software. It is a concept, deployed the way the
concept of a directed acyclic graph is deployed: not by writing one DAG
program and installing it everywhere, but by using the concept wherever it isƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Iv2agS6F_MEYXfKv_xOlJKj60iOGCLkrJcsv-OjYphAƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;QeZ83e75gM8t42QpTEjqAjw3o3zpFkpUHEyGrZuO-50ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkb51ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Pi3yTxtetbPh0obM08-uo1cEqzIE1H3Hmq2nHUNvDUsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;tNEPG4w89D4ZEfpAfPPYHSQZAFZw7sTMByHiix0ZQ4Uƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkmdistal bypassƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;WWi6JvLbdr8GK5PR_K2HB2AgZ_wwaoLP6gI8o9V741Yƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarky-   certificates; none of them ever needs to see the mathematics.

