## Abstract

This paper defines "Visual Engineering Practices" as a composite discipline assembled from four lineages â€” [Bauhaus pedagogy](../../../schools/bauhaus-pedagogy.md), [Brutalism](../../../schools/brutalism.md) (as ethic and constraint-set), [Cubism](../../../schools/cubism.md) (as anti-closure tactics), and [Edward Tufte's information design](../../../schools/tuftean-information-design.md) (as integrity under constraint). The project is not to produce an eclectic style, but to enumerate portable constraints in their native terms and show how, in combination, they yield specific outcomes: [glance-direction](../terms/glance-direction.md) (rapid orienting), [non-linear reading](../terms/non-linear-reading.md) (designed routing rather than smooth consumption), [felt weight](../terms/felt-weight.md) (perceptual mass and structural emphasis), [peripheral uptake](../terms/peripheral-uptake.md) (pre-attentive and field-based [legibility](../../../../sociology/terms/legibility.md)), and [memetic repeatability](../terms/memetic-repeatability.md) (a learnable kit that travels). The paper proceeds in two passes: (1) a lineage catalog that states each inherited "move" and why it matters for the target outcomes; and (2) a synthesis that treats the composite as a system whose shared target is [orientation before interpretation](../concepts/orientation-before-interpretation.md) and whose shared enemy is [premature closure](../concepts/premature-closure.md). The final sections translate the constraints into repeatable layout "recipes," provide worked readings of three representative artifacts (as analytic templates), and name refusals necessary to keep the composite coherent.

**Keywords:** visual attention, perceptual organization, Bauhaus, Brutalism, Cubism, information desƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;lRUuYOOZxoYoasyTYEqSy-vVmG0tona7mehm9FGTFoYƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;HnJILLJvGYPx-YQZY5_zTUnEtfiJ94lO6eqFR5N0XxEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkb47ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Xtlrlg_BGSVqc-9tO5LJ15PNX4BrHVkiRyDGRg1Z0Ooƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;kQy4fbH7LNZfP-Rfb9fB9i8u5TG3Xc3mF9CvtSI8OHAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkrVisual Engineeringƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;59uRQh5ZmaeS64GkPwL1HCmKGIy8GkKpCYtnEYg2L-Iƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkye### 1.1 The project: an explicit composite discipline

"Visual Engineering Practices" names a working kit: a deliberately assembled composite discipline rather than a single tradition or a personal "style." The engineering claim is modest and specific. It does not mean formal proof, nor does it borrow engineering authority as a rhetorical costume. It means that the practice is constraint-led: it selects, formalizes, and repeatedly applies constraints that reliably generate certain perceptual behaviors in readers.

The paper's job is to (a) enumerate constraints as each tradition understood them (or, where necessary, as faithfully as possible given translation across media), and (b) explain why the composite produces the outcomes repeatedly observed in the artifacts: gaze routing, non-linear reading, felt weight, peripheral uptake, and memetic repeatability.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;eX9gJgWqw85khs6WnF2DtkypkUcaZywe1dOLdJtVq3Iƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkgcurrentƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;P1Up_7RLGxUakCz5-Z2s8a3IpRLpidsmpwx6ZC-II1Qƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;CydZ2icpHanh1mIgqZiv2RLGJWSKMQJqLhgA_ithwIgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkc444ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;nRrwXITb540_9pZWTp3eVjMKy9grLyAANdyIrB_P7TAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;X4h0AziAPXCspXiLGkXFxYPxOvu9Qy4rSynKw3M3CyYƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;1XhLCFEQyDXC3ja2BtcrhQR-rQ6cnRfHTadJNS4wJToƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;J8o5fmaTN_by8mBv88klULjBB2qLDxrSekOx9i0cgjsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;JBVuv6iH3Ftw7OCBqEUwmTpqoiBujNlP5zOaxrROJtoƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkpmarket.561.groupƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;5rtqrTRwq-e4ItL3m6Mt0jtEqkssxKlundSu316UhFAƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx