  - "Felt Weight"ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;mZk8QL44AcJ_OcOxa6-UtGiwjVqk-7oLZAZwyi1hZSwƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;1c320kuWutNnXFoVsiI_UtIYoApKlMIs2SzZu-Rd-u4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkb18ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ktEHgP505d1Ghtt-5eChuwBg3An1iU6gXWjXx6TOwGkƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;SrjEuhkoVHs3wNDL5OfcKVLV_09UQEUHXYZTPSRjQNQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkrVisual Engineeringƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;dI5hdKXfoiq7V3W7f2BnSSuEJRoE4oyryYfD_rXJyGsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarky°---

Felt weight is one of five operational outcomes defined by [visual engineering practices](../index.md). It names the artifact's capacity to carry perceptual mass â€” blocks, contrasts, voids, and alignments that feel load-bearing. Weight is used as structure, not as decoration.

Felt weight arises from [Bauhaus](../../../schools/bauhaus-pedagogy.md) constructive typography (type as mass), structured ground (void as beam), and [brutalist](../../../schools/brutalism.md) bluntness (blocks that declare their load-bearing role). Weight is then constrained by [Tuftean](../../../schools/tuftean-information-design.md) honesty: weight must correspond to structural priority, not hype.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;eDfIKfVyE3_tjWsW1P5heY0zAjBL_HOez6dvZiwvkzcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkgcurrentƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;-QieyX81I57rVE9RbZ_Jej4rEhyv-1GG1mlpobGoKBkƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Ts4XCdCHZz4zidP2uD_rwwsAdW7nR55Bt-6qOYelGH4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkd1828ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;jUqEbPVi_0zNowLrt0seTmzGyd4_eTRinFicRhxaedkƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;zAy7eCn0nepWvtozF9mFs034lShEmC3v01OoF1h_Jvcƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;lRLFPWuXHaBYQXnkVN3Jt7Fq6cN0yOqy3Iy6XNHl3k8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;MOL63yx5ps-BiKPgQYw5BDzjg1WuQPPyUQtd124OK3Iƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;IVQS6WARUo6QzM2fIEifQXJF5m8_BU4B9vdrvx7vh58ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkrVisual Engineeringƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;8zhCge_RK60CyiF0J-UmdaDM0Z6TPQCtkTDHzWu0TrEƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdu