Glance-direction is one of five operational outcomes defined by [visual engineering practices](../index.md). It names the artifact's capacity to produce a fast "first grasp" of where to look and what to do next. This is not the same as comprehension; it is the reduction of initial uncertainty.

Glance-direction arises when [Bauhaus](../../../schools/bauhaus-pedagogy.md) construction (clear relational field) is paired with [brutalist](../../../schools/brutalism.md) hierarchy (hard, sparse contrasts) under [Tuftean](../../../schools/tuftean-information-design.md) budgeting (few marks that matter). The eye is not asked to choose among many equal candidates; it is given a small number of structurally meaningful anchors.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;x4y6wBtl7i5tFSoZzUitfvEeDXKyFchl75D69LEvzl8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkgcurrentƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;YQml2S0wn8SXb3kEM173rBURpN3yyYNP0IsX0RwkP2Aƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;cXixeVsgWsF4RiYZaGTVnJNmvglbA9p1589z7yoCvHIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkd1767ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;fO82vaVReV6udO9I263vtPrGwnQkGA1kyIneFI2_yYMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;RPHPVx0_Ig381SEKDE9wOzpufyNWttIWEM8pt947w5Eƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;8FhdYRaBjKDybqeYWynnt5QB2Kp6_j3IoMXrB2N-c2kƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;zO_syB6XAtLOlQw0VUr8qwYXlLJ7u4RYPU5kuata8Ccƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;IfYYnrOXlzftXUNONp-H_w_EiVGv3nCZ0iTX48lUQWMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkrVisual Engineeringƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;KPwM4l8ht_xzOiSIfVW9PY-GTHWFeSSqt7SrtMYI9Iwƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsu