Memetic repeatability is one of five operational outcomes defined by [visual engineering practices](../index.md). It names the practice's capacity for transmission: the kit propagates because it can be taught as constraints and checks, not as ineffable taste. It travels through re-performance, not merely through slogans.

Memetic repeatability arises because the composite is teachable as constraints: a limited device-set, explicit hierarchy rules, repeatable fragmentation tactics, and integrity checks. Each of these can be named, demonstrated, and re-applied by other makers without requiring access to the original practitioner's sensibility.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;GqtQFe8YPRuTdRqZYvGd6tnHuuM3zI1Mo6LJ4QyyuDUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkgcurrentƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;akQDUysWXSu1MvTzrHycVsh2JKXUTBRVxY4MZ-bxo-Qƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;fdfsR-K-S9kazFWpbrhLyuphserMEFoHB-vnedPdru0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkd1691ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;r1WguEuoBSbt4UNiP5CtibzvfiO6o4K9xuSUaTKPtiEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;bBFsy4t00UQgiPq99KPPa51Mj4ISslz4SK8clcBNvdwƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;SFRXjvqF0nq5hJQ3zXE8pH9xXIcfRflPloOC23-M6kcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;EdXFHnT6zhpwWLhZ5iTjHuBvoQJkL1BRKXKvwAAJrvoƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;jI8pLl1ilt3C6hvN4D_zatdo24A-zDFsSZ43sCs6NM0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkrVisual Engineeringƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;qMQSmgXCEnDCvsVuPkuYBpWjQDAaK3wZjHEOsv6eNwoƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;nN3fhx