Peripheral uptake is one of five operational outcomes defined by [visual engineering practices](../index.md). It names the artifact's capacity to remain legible without foveal inspection â€” salient relations and hierarchies can be read in the visual field before the reader focuses on any specific element.

Peripheral uptake arises because the composition is legible at coarse resolution: blocks, edges, alignments, and sparse salience cues remain visible without fine detail. [Bauhaus](../../../schools/bauhaus-pedagogy.md) figure/ground discipline and [brutalist](../../../schools/brutalism.md) device scarcity keep the macro structure detectable; [Tuftean](../../../schools/tuftean-information-design.md) grouping integrity ensures that the field-level reading is truthful.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Zgk40jm0p5U3Jd9MCA_heBOSyC6J6cTvi1hDStgrZY4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkgcurrentƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;mjjIeFJypcm8rWURv_QjDNIWX2qHZArWWRLPCFRsr8Eƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;QkLVKxQDKLPQggneTojA5ccMWc3-3k3-dgnUwegeJdcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkd2493ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;t07VGVzwUqsAlMXzjtBGf2brex9LWy7r87BwETJOdsYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;9HTQPXnkMKgBMIOlZJOr8CcB9IbHpRtLwG7H4zIRlJYƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;C5UKw7QfxO3h2p-9HseTLLpWW6UiUwyuPAEydynvuNgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;eRrUxXLX6eX7yvnPzbUcwCnD66tEutcy-cVqupiQNSIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;0m_V1duT2fbH571Lz7VkJ7-_s32C-gCM-a5Eca6sRZoƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkrVisual Engineeringƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Sw3FhI2lgGA0mKJVfGBU5xLq-lvDz6OmNeLAQmcKU8sƒdpa